      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6a35c00df51f79a5dba7cd27|full_name}\n\nDo you happen to think that I should be the one paying VRChat to get you verified?\n\nJust because *you* aren't paying for VRChat doesn't mean it's free; someone else is paying so that you can play without cost.",
